{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1368.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"7471a27f0c49546b0082c5dd328bdfa86836b5ddaf5dad739c795b2db8b3f058","ja":"壁の花？","zh":"壁花？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1368.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"970476077d5eac6b7fbd19cbc7639ad7b8a416f0ac85e3ba75a432849c4859a5","ja":"今日のお仕事はパーティーのゲスト。\nとても格式高いパーティーのようで……","zh":"今天的工作是担任派对的嘉宾。\n似乎是一场格外高规格的派对……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1368.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"0ccd4412e5b1fd0076443c674c5cc64e8ab2c1bf9f22954b7928fb19766f5a96","ja":"なんだかすごそうな料理がいっぱい……。\nすっごく豪華なパーティーですね……！","zh":"感觉有好多好厉害的菜肴……\n真是场超级豪华的派对呢……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1368.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3be232d67660dd3b175ce815cc1f57feacc7f3090fdce991d11a30680e4aceb0","ja":"それにテレビで見かける社長さんや俳優さん……\nみんなすごい人たちばっかりですよ！","zh":"而且电视上常能见到的社长和演员……\n全都是厉害的大人物啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1368.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"6f96c9309a9eba7d3f11d69f78c80bddb6e4c4b47d2c93b6b732f6cc98291d5d","ja":"あんたたち、浮かれすぎよ！\nこんなの、全然たいしたことないじゃない。","zh":"你们未免也太得意忘形了吧！\n这种事情，根本就没什么大不了的嘛。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1368.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"14367e8cc1925df8f66183bd140b182430a81d5e4a61f751cc5625b4ca14e629","ja":"そ、そんなこと言われても……。\n私には馴染みがなくて、居心地が悪くて……。","zh":"就、就算你这么说……\n我不太习惯，总觉得很不自在……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1368.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"4dda1304c8bf58bd56952150e8dc8be4394db51663f80bb8d7495f5ac4150421","ja":"み、みんな、落ち着いて！　一度深呼吸しよう。\nスー、ハァー……スー、ハァー……。","zh":"大、大家冷静点！先深呼吸一次。\n吸——呼——……吸——呼——……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1368.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"b3989c1e234b5234aea211dc96ef231294acafd66f38749c8b707498a0a1ba42","ja":"……って、全然落ち着かないや！","zh":"……不对，根本冷静不下来啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1368.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"4e9010a0af9356834c728b11a0c49e7ddee4c4c6d2dd098fec5fd74695575667","ja":"あ、あのー……ありさたち、\n本当にここにいてもいいんでしょうか……？","zh":"那个……亚利沙她们，\n真的可以留在这里吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1368.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"d85b71fa3bb7cf187a8e3496868342f637aea8303ace1913ede6375c9c62d385","ja":"なんだか、私たちだけ\n浮いちゃってるみたいですよね……。","zh":"总觉得，好像只有我们\n显得格格不入呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1368.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"91e3903d8245aef0569982328eb055ff2395c1478780828a254c0a66d579b8c7","ja":"いいに決まってるでしょ。パーティーを主催してる\n企業が私たちの映画を観て、声をかけてきたんだから。","zh":"那还用说吗。毕竟是主办派对的\n企业看了我们的电影后，主动来邀请我们的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1368.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"c7a6107e2bc7a24246b4d74441f99ec674fd5654d5fb0b665d60287ef7837310","ja":"招待されたってことはゲストにふさわしいってことよ。\nもっと堂々としてなさい！","zh":"既然受到了邀请，就说明你配得上做嘉宾。\n再更堂堂正正一点吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
